      "content": "ok i tried some juice but i feel even more shaky and dizzy now. i'm really worried about my sugar swinging too far the other way. if i just take like 2 units of my fast acting insulin right now it might help level it out so i dont get a massive spike later? i just want to stabilize it so i dont feel so crazy",
